  characterName: Captain Light
  characterAvatar: {fileID: 4723107735738678597, guid: 6ca7701dd33647344a233657ae4c8424, type: 3}
  combinedLines: '"Be at ease, little one. I am Captain Light." | "Roaming this blighted
    world alone breeds a corruption within your soul. A toxin born of malice and
    despair. Without a guide to cleanse it, the corruption will consume you. You
    will die before you even taste your revenge."'
